# Fab data is never committed. Git is not a data lake, and wafer-level
# measurement data is customer-confidential in a foundry context.
#
# Committed:   schemas/, reference/ (small, reviewable, versioned contracts)
# Not committed: raw/, external/, interim/, processed/, archive/, synthetic/
#
# Reproducibility is guaranteed by the generators in scripts/simulation/ and the
# pipeline definitions in src/spc_platform/pipelines/, not by stored blobs.

raw/**
external/**
interim/**
processed/**
archive/**
synthetic/**

# Keep the directory skeleton and its documentation.
!**/.gitkeep
!**/README.md

# Reference and schema data are versioned deliberately.
!reference/**
!schemas/**
